  aciklama:
  - "Fincan g\xF6rsellerini a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131mda, tam saat {{sayi,11,13}}
    y\xF6n\xFCnde seni bir somon bal\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n pe\u015Fine tak\u0131lm\u0131\u015F,
    y\xFCzerken g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Bu yans\u0131malar sevimli ve hay\u0131rl\u0131
    gibi g\xF6z\xFCkse de, t\xFCketilmesi en sa\u011Fl\u0131kl\u0131 bal\u0131klardan
    biri olan somon fallarda y\xFCksek kolesterole i\u015Faret eder {{isim}}. Son
    zamanlarda hamur i\u015Fi, cips, k\u0131zartma, i\u015Flenmi\u015F et ya da kat\u0131
    ya\u011F t\xFCketimin bir \u015Fekilde artm\u0131\u015F g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor. \U0001F9D0Abur
    cuburlardan uzak durmal\u0131, kalp sa\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 koruyabilmek
    ad\u0131na tedbiri elden b\u0131rakmamal\u0131s\u0131n. Bolca y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015F
    yapmak, ceviz ve su t\xFCketmek de seni yine olas\u0131 kalp ve damar hastal\u0131klar\u0131ndan
    korur. Kamu spotu gibi ba\u015Flad\u0131k; hadi hay\u0131rl\u0131s\u0131... <sprite=0>"
